-- Step 10 of 10 - The account, as a T -------------------------------------------------------------
  Accountants draw an account as a T: debits on the left, credits on the right, the balance at the
  bottom. This is account 6140 today, with the igniter among its debits. After apply, a credit of
  214.77 joins the right side and the balance drops by the same.
  Why this matters: Every balance is just its debits less its credits; the T shows which entries
  make it.
